---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Crystal Cleansing & Care Guide | SomaShiva™">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 shadow-sm">Sacred Rituals</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#7A5212] mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight">Crystal Cleansing & Care Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
        Crystals absorb and transmit energetic vibrations from their surroundings. To keep your sacred stones working at their highest potential, regular cleansing and recharging are essential.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cleansing Methods -->
    <div class="space-y-12 mb-20">
      <!-- Moonlight Charging -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532693322450-2cb5c511067d?w=600" alt="Moonlight Charging" class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-56 w-full shadow-sm border border-[#E6CA65]/40" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
          <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3">Recharging Practice</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515] mb-3">Full Moonlight Bathing</h2>
          <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-sm">
            The gentle, receptive energy of the moon is the safest and most effective way to recharge all crystal types without risk of fading or damage. 
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#4A3B2C]">
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Place crystals on a windowsill or outdoor surface during the night of the Full Moon.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Set an intentional affirmation to clear stagnant energy.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Retrieve them the following morning energized and renewed.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Selenite Cleansing -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567225557594-88d73e55f2cb?w=600" alt="Selenite Cleansing" class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-56 w-full shadow-sm border border-[#E6CA65]/40" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
          <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3">Purification Ritual</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515] mb-3">Selenite Charging Plates</h2>
          <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-sm">
            Selenite is a high-vibration master cleansing crystal that never needs cleansing itself. It actively neutralizes lower frequencies in neighboring stones.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#4A3B2C]">
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Place your jewelry and tumbled stones directly on a Selenite slab or charging bowl.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Leave overnight for complete energetic reset.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Note: Keep Selenite away from water as it is water-soluble.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Smudging -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599566150163-29194dcaad36?w=600" alt="Smudging & Smoke" class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-56 w-full shadow-sm border border-[#E6CA65]/40" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-2/3">
          <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3">Smoke Cleansing</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515] mb-3">Sacred Smoke & Sound</h2>
          <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-sm">
            Passing crystals through the sacred smoke of white sage, palo santo, or bathing them in singing bowl resonance instantly breaks up dense energetic attachments.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#4A3B2C]">
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Pass each crystal through the rising smoke for 30 seconds.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Use singing bowl tones to vibrate and shake loose lingering heavy energies.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>Always ensure proper ventilation during indoor smoke cleansing.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive FAQ Section -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 shadow-sm">Got Questions?</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#7A5212]">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4" id="faq-container">
        <!-- FAQ 1 -->
        <div class="border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left bg-amber-50/40 hover:bg-amber-50 transition font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-xl text-[#7A5212]">
            <span>How often should I cleanse my crystals?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#996515] transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
            We recommend cleansing your crystals at least once a month, ideally during the Full Moon. If your crystals are exposed to heavy emotional stress or intense spiritual work, you can cleanse them weekly using Selenite or sound baths.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 2 -->
        <div class="border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left bg-amber-50/40 hover:bg-amber-50 transition font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-xl text-[#7A5212]">
            <span>What is the delivery timeline for direct orders?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#996515] transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
            All direct orders are hand-cleansed, energetically charged, and securely dispatched within 3 to 5 business days. Standard delivery across India takes an additional 3-7 business days.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 3 -->
        <div class="border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition">
          <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left bg-amber-50/40 hover:bg-amber-50 transition font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-xl text-[#7A5212]">
            <span>Are all SomaShiva™ crystals 100% natural and authentic?</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#996515] transform transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
            Yes, every single crystal and mineral specimen in our collection is 100% natural, ethically sourced from miners worldwide, and rigorously hand-inspected for authenticity.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle');

    toggles.forEach(toggle => {
      toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const content = toggle.nextElementSibling as HTMLElement;
        const icon = toggle.querySelector('svg');

        content.classList.toggle('hidden');
        if (icon) {
          icon.classList.toggle('rotate-180');
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
